          "snippet": {
            "line": 921,
            "text": "theorem exponential_integral_left {f : ℝ → ℝ} (a b : ℝ) (hb : 0 < b)\n    (he : ∀ t ≤ 0, f t = a * Real.exp (b * t)) {y : ℝ} (hy : y ≤ 0) :\n    (∫ t in Iic y, f t) = (a / b) * Real.exp (b * y)"
